            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start with a magic ring. Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Rounds 4-6: dc around. Round 7: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Stuff. Round 8: dc2tog x 6 (6 sts). Close."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ears (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Magic ring, 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Slip stitch to close. Leave a tail for sewing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the top of the body. Sew ears to the top of the head at 10 and 2 o'clock. Embroider a small nose and two French-knot eyes. Attach a jump ring and keychain clip through the top of the head."
          }
        ]
      }
